    "modifier_omniknight_9_0": "Hammer of Purity Attack Range Increase: 100 \n\n Hammer of Purity Attack Accuracy: 100%",
    "modifier_omniknight_9_1": "Hammer of Purity Attack Range Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b> \n\n Hammer of Purity Attack Accuracy: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b>",
